§ `s 4 excluded`

#ASSERT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `an owner selling their own flat`
#ASSERT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `an executor selling the deceased's house`
#ASSERT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `a solicitor who only introduces a buyer`
#ASSERT NOT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `a solicitor who also negotiates the price`
#ASSERT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `a listings portal that only publishes advertisements`
#ASSERT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `an employer finding housing for its employee`
#ASSERT NOT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `a friend introducing a buyer for a fee`
#ASSERT NOT `the Act does not apply to what the actor does` `a property agency firm`

